@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Bausteinsicht – WirSchiffenDas Engine Quality Analysis

actor "Ingenieur" as Engineer
actor "Postman\n(Test-Client)" as Postman

component "web-ui\nReact + Material UI + Vite" as WebUI
component "configuration-service" as Configuration
component "analysis-management-service" as Management
component "fluid-analysis-service" as Fluid
component "thermal-analysis-service" as Thermal
component "electrical-analysis-service" as Electrical
component "engine-management-analysis-service" as Engine

database "Configuration DB" as ConfigDb
database "Analysis DB" as AnalysisDb

Engineer --> WebUI : Browser
WebUI --> Configuration : REST\nKonfiguration anlegen/lesen
WebUI --> Management : REST\nAnalyse starten/status/retry
Postman --> Configuration : REST (Test)
Postman --> Management : REST (Test)

Configuration --> ConfigDb : besitzt / persistiert
Management --> AnalysisDb : besitzt / persistiert

Management --> Configuration : Konfiguration laden
Management --> Fluid : Anchor starten
Fluid --> Thermal : Choreographie
Thermal --> Electrical : Choreographie
Electrical --> Engine : Choreographie

Fluid --> Management : Status / Resultat
Thermal --> Management : Status / Resultat
Electrical --> Management : Status / Resultat
Engine --> Management : Status / Resultat

WebUI ..> Configuration : Actuator Health\nvia Reverse Proxy
WebUI ..> Management : Actuator / CB State
WebUI ..> Fluid : Actuator / CB State
WebUI ..> Thermal : Actuator / CB State
WebUI ..> Electrical : Actuator / CB State
WebUI ..> Engine : Actuator Health

note bottom of WebUI
  Präsentationskomponente
  keine Ablauf-Orchestration
end note
note bottom of Fluid
  stateless
end note
note bottom of Thermal
  stateless
end note
note bottom of Electrical
  stateless
end note
note bottom of Engine
  stateless
end note

@enduml
